== Contributor Guidelines ==

{| style="width:100%; border:1px solid #4b4a2f; background:#10151d; margin:0 0 18px 0;"
| style="padding:14px 18px; color:#e2e2cf;" |
<div style="font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:135%; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; color:#d8ca72; border-bottom:2px solid #706b3d; padding-bottom:4px; margin-bottom:12px;">CONTRIBUTOR GUIDELINES</div>

When creating a new class-combination guide:

* Use the page name generated by the selector.
* Focus on how the classes work together rather than rewriting the individual class pages.
* Link back to the individual class pages for class-specific details, such as spell lists, song lists, active skills, disciplines, and AAs.
* Use existing single-class pages as references, but do not copy large sections from them unless they directly apply to the combination.
* Add practical advice: camps, roles, tactics, strengths, weaknesses, and gear priorities.
* See the [[Sample Build]] for formatting help.
|}

